1
00:00:00,600 --> 00:00:13,320
The IERS table of TAI-UTC runs from 10 seconds in 1972 to 37 seconds
in 2017, each value exactly one second more than the one before it.

2
00:00:13,333 --> 00:00:19,309
No leap second has ever been subtracted from civil
time; every one on record has only been added.
